# 服务设计 PWA UI/UX Redesign Implementation Plan

> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.

**Goal:** Redesign the existing PWA prototype into a classroom dashboard interface while preserving core classroom functions.

**Architecture:** Keep `src/app-core.mjs` unchanged except if tests expose a functional issue. Replace the static shell in `index.html`, update rendering in `src/app.js`, and rewrite `src/styles.css` around dashboard, timeline, task cards and feedback panels.

**Tech Stack:** HTML, CSS, vanilla JavaScript modules, Node.js syntax checks and app-core tests.

## Global Constraints

- Work inside `C:/Users/zf/Documents/智慧课程建设/output/20260630_服务设计PWA原型_v01/`.
- Do not remove existing classroom functions.
- Keep the prototype static and locally runnable.
- Verify with tests, resource checks and browser screenshot.

